{quote}[CPU measurements |https://taxify.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/ENGINEERING/pages/4288414329/2023+Q1+CPU+measurements+of+searchworker+iteration+2]showed that a lot of time is spent resolving driver strategies. Resolve strategy cache can and should be shared for orders in a group.{quote}

