{quote}dispatch_area_id should be returned for orders if drivers were taken from a FIFO dispatch area. We want to exclude such orders from reassignment, at least for now.{quote}

Currently, this is done in a sequential manner: ride-matching-worker calls {{/matchOrder}} for these orders one-by-one, in a “greedy” manner. Once we decide to use orders from dispatch area in a matrix matching, we need to think about it once again to come with a good solution.



{quote}Try to batch routes for multiple orders in a single getEtas request (400 is the hard limit on geo side), they should be notified when we start testing the new endpoint.{quote}

