Hi,

{quote}why the service fee is charged from the amount before tax {quote}

Because the service fee is 10% of the net ride price fare. 

{quote}why the amount charged for the service fee (RON3.52) doesn't represent 10% of the total sum of the invoice (RON41.90).{quote}

Because the Service Fee is a charge on top of the ride price not inclusive of the ride price. 

More information here: [https://taxify.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/COMM/pages/1064142946/Service+Fee+-+10+Business+Portal+Fee|https://taxify.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/COMM/pages/1064142946/Service+Fee+-+10+Business+Portal+Fee|smart-link]

